# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# SportShield AI — Environment Variables
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# Never commit the actual .env file to version control.

# ── Environment ──
ENVIRONMENT=production
# DOMAIN=sportshield.ai          # Uncomment when domain is ready

# ── Database ──
POSTGRES_USER=sportshield
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME_STRONG_PASSWORD_HERE
POSTGRES_DB=sportshield
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://sportshield:CHANGE_ME@postgres:5432/sportshield
DATABASE_URL_SYNC=postgresql://sportshield:CHANGE_ME@postgres:5432/sportshield

# ── Redis ──
REDIS_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME_REDIS_PASSWORD
REDIS_URL=redis://:CHANGE_ME_REDIS_PASSWORD@redis:6379/0

# ── JWT Auth ──
SECRET_KEY=GENERATE_A_SECRET_KEY_AT_LEAST_32_CHARACTERS_LONG
ALGORITHM=HS256
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=30
REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRE_DAYS=7

# ── File Storage ──
# Set to "s3" for production AWS deployment
STORAGE_BACKEND=local
LOCAL_STORAGE_PATH=./uploads
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
AWS_S3_BUCKET=
AWS_REGION=us-east-1

# ── Search APIs (for violation scanning) ──
GOOGLE_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_CSE_ID=
BING_API_KEY=
SERPAPI_KEY=

# ── Email (SendGrid) ──
SENDGRID_API_KEY=
SENDGRID_FROM_EMAIL=alerts@sportshield.ai

# ── CORS ──
# In production, set this to your actual domain
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:80

# ── FAISS Index ──
FAISS_INDEX_PATH=./faiss_data/faiss_index.bin
FAISS_MAP_PATH=./faiss_data/faiss_id_map.json
